<view class="page">
 <view class="hero"><text wx:if="{{isDemo}}" class="demo-badge">演示模式</text><view class="hero-title">{{detail.master.name || code}}</view><text class="hero-sub">{{code}} · {{detail.master.market || '市场缺失'}} · {{detail.master.sector || '分类缺失'}}\n数据日 {{detail.release.statistic_date || '--'}}</text></view>
 <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}<button class="secondary retry" bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在加载趋势…</view>
 <block wx:else>
  <view class="card"><view class="status-grid"><view class="status-cell"><text class="status-value {{detail.snapshot.tone}}">{{detail.snapshot.deltaText}}</text><text class="status-label">份额增量</text></view><view class="status-cell"><text class="status-value {{detail.snapshot.tone}}">{{detail.snapshot.rateText}}</text><text class="status-label">份额变化率</text></view><view class="status-cell"><text class="status-value {{detail.snapshot.price_change_rate>0?'positive':'negative'}}">{{detail.snapshot.priceText}}</text><text class="status-label">同期价格</text></view><view class="status-cell"><text class="status-value">{{detail.availablePoints}}</text><text class="status-label">可用数据点</text></view></view><button class="{{watched?'danger':'primary'}} watch" bindtap="toggleWatch" loading="{{watchBusy}}">{{watched?'移除自选':'加入自选'}}</button></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-head"><text class="card-title">历史趋势</text><text class="muted">统一区间</text></view><view class="tabs"><view wx:for="{{[7,30,90]}}" wx:key="*this" class="tab {{period===item?'active':''}}" data-period="{{item}}" bindtap="changePeriod">近{{item}}日</view></view><view wx:if="{{selected}}" class="selected">{{selected.date}} · 份额 {{selected.sharesText}} · 价格 {{selected.closeText}}</view><text class="chart-title">份额（亿份）</text><canvas class="chart" canvas-id="shareChart" bindtap="selectPoint"></canvas><text class="chart-title">前复权收盘价（CNY）</text><canvas class="chart" canvas-id="priceChart" bindtap="selectPoint"></canvas><text class="muted">图中断点代表缺失，未进行插值。历史不足时仅展示实际可用区间。</text></view>
  <view class="card"><view class="card-title">观察信息</view><view class="observation"><text>连续变化</text><text>{{detail.streak.direction==='increase'?'连续增加':detail.streak.direction==='decrease'?'连续减少':'未形成连续'}} {{detail.streak.days || 0}} 日</text></view><view class="observation"><text>异动倍数</text><text>{{detail.anomalyText}}</text></view><text class="muted">异动倍数为当日绝对份额变化率除以前20个有效交易日绝对变化率中位数，不代表统计显著性或买卖信号。</text></view>
  <view class="notice warning">{{detail.release.disclaimer}}</view>
 </block>
</view>

